</section>
  <section class="cv-sec"><div class="cv-wrap">
  <div class="section-head cv-shead"><div class="section-kick cv-kick">ISSUES</div><h2 class="section-h2 cv-h2">我關心的議題</h2></div>
  <div class="cv-chips"><a class="cv-chip" href="/issues/traffic/"><svg class="cv-cic" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M184,32H72a8,8,0,0,0-8,8V216a8,8,0,0,0,8,8H184a8,8,0,0,0,8-8V40A8,8,0,0,0,184,32ZM128,192a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,192Zm0-80a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,112Z" opacity="0.2"/><path d="M128,56a32,32,0,1,0,32,32A32,32,0,0,0,128,56Zm0,48a16,16,0,1,1,16-16A16,16,0,0,1,128,104Zm0,32a32,32,0,1,0,32,32A32,32,0,0,0,128,136Zm0,48a16,16,0,1,1,16-16A16,16,0,0,1,128,184Zm88-40H200V80h16a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H200V40a16,16,0,0,0-16-16H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,40V64H40a8,8,0,0,0,0,16H56v64H40a8,8,0,0,0,0,16H56v56a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H184a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V160h16a8,8,0,0,0,0-16Zm-32,72H72V40H184V216Z"/></svg>交通與通勤安全</a><a class="cv-chip" href="/issues/youth/"><svg class="cv-cic" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 256 256"><path d="M224,128a96,96,0,1,1-96-96A96,96,0,0,1,224,128Z" opacity="0.2"/><path d="M92,140a12,12,0,1,1,12-12A12,12,0,0,1,92,140Zm72-24a12,12,0,1,0,12,12A12,12,0,0,0,164,116Zm-12.27,45.23a45,45,0,0,1-47.46,0,8,8,0,0,0-8.54,13.54,61,61,0,0,0,64.54,0,8,8,0,0,0-8.54-13.54ZM232,128A104,104,0,1,1,128,24,104.11,104.11,0,0,1,232,128Zm-16,0a88.11,88.11,0,0,0-84.09-87.91C120.32,56.38,120,71.88,120,72a8,8,0,0,0,16,0,8,8,0,0,1,16,0,24,24,0,0,1-48,0c0-.73.13-14.3,8.46-30.63A88,88,0,1,0,216,128Z"/></svg>兒少與教育</a><span class="cv-chip off">居住與土地正義</span><span class="cv-chip off">健康與社會福利</span><span class="cv-chip off">勞動與在地經濟</span></div>
</div></section>
  
  <section class="cv-sec cv-fellowsec"><div class="cv-wrap">
  <div class="section-head cv-shead"><div class="section-kick cv-kick">TEAM</div><h2 class="section-h2 cv-h2">看看台灣前進<span class="u">新北市的夥伴</span></h2></div>
  <div class="cv-fellows"><a class="cv-fcard" href="/kan-chung-wei"><span class="cv-fava"><img src="/assets/faces/head/kan-chung-wei.webp" alt="甘崇緯" loading="lazy"></span><div><div class="cv-fn">甘崇緯</div><div class="cv-fm"><span class="cv-pdot" style="background:var(--gp)"></span>台灣綠黨 新莊</div></div></a><a class="cv-fcard" href="/chang-yu-fu"><span class="cv-fava"><img src="/assets/faces/head/chang-yu-fu.webp" alt="張佑輔" loading="lazy"></span><div><div class="cv-fn">張佑輔</div><div class="cv-fm"><span class="cv-pdot" style="background:var(--gp)"></span>台灣綠黨 新店、深坑、石碇、坪林、烏來</div></div></a><a class="cv-fcard" href="/kuo-shu-cheng"><span class="cv-fava"><img src="/assets/faces/head/kuo-shu-cheng.webp" alt="郭書成" loading="lazy"></span><div><div class="cv-fn">郭書成</div><div class="cv-fm"><span class="cv-pdot" style="background:var(--fwd)"></span>台灣前進 汐止、萬里、金山</div></div></a></div>
